=== SECTION 8: ATTRIBUTE REFERENCE ===
9 attributes (range 1-20): speed, skill, strength, save (GK-only), discipline,
dribbling, passing, shooting, stamina. Pass/shoot formulas use
effective_skill = (2 * specialised + skill) / 3. Every action other than Hold
drains current_health; Hold and low-speed Move recover; half-time restores fully.

=== SECTION 9: ROSTER ACCESS ===
Roster size and player IDs vary by config. NEVER hardcode player_ids or
assume roster size. Iterate Object.entries(game_state.players) to find
teammates and opponents. Filter by .team and .role.

=== SECTION 10: FORMATION + SNAP MECHANICS ===
snap_force = Math.min(discipline / 100, 0.20)   // at most 20%
final_pos  = (1 - snap_force) * move_result + snap_force * formation_position

Active intent BYPASSES snap entirely:
  - Any Move with speed >= 0.5
  - Any action by the ball carrier
formation_position shifts each tick: x by team_phase, y by ball-side compaction.
Read player_state.formation_zone_phase and game_state.team_phase.

